1
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:12,600
♪Wealth fades away, fame fades away♪

2
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,760
♪All worldly pursuits
are fleeting dreams♪

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,300
♪Sorrow fades away,
resentment fades away♪

4
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:22,830
♪Anger and grudges are
but passing clouds♪

5
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,270
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

6
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:30,110
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

7
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:37,170
♪This humble monk wanders freely
across the land♪

8
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,390
♪Laughing and fooling around,
yet bound by karma's law♪

9
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,910
♪People spend their lives chasing
fortune and fearing misfortune♪

10
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,070
♪Yet in a blink, all return to dust♪

11
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:50,200
♪They scheme endlessly in pursuit
of wealth and glory♪

12
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:53,560
♪But in the end, all things
simply pass by♪

13
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:57,320
♪Better to follow the heart
and find true joy♪

14
00:00:57,610 --> 00:01:00,480
♪Don't let worldly troubles
bind your soul♪

15
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:02,100
♪Walk on, walk on♪

16
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:03,810
♪Roam on, roam on♪

17
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:07,410
♪With my worn-out fan in hand,
I care not for worldly woes♪

18
00:01:07,450 --> 00:01:08,690
♪Drink some wine♪

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,470
♪Sail the rivers wide♪

20
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,880
♪Simple robes and straw sandals
beat fine silk and fur♪

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,040
♪Laugh at my carefree ways, a simple
fan is all I need to chase worries away♪

22
00:01:17,070 --> 00:01:20,560
♪Laugh at my shabby look, a half pot
of wine carries me through the years♪

23
00:01:20,590 --> 00:01:23,720
♪Wine and meat may pass through me,
but kindness stays in my heart♪

24
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:26,980
♪I cling not to appearances,
finding freedom through Zen's wisdom♪

25
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:29,040
♪I travel north and south,
witnessing the world's endless tales♪

26
00:01:29,870 --> 00:01:32,520
♪I see life's joys and sorrows
in a single glance♪

27
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:36,120
♪Those who harm the good and abuse
their power will face their reckoning♪

28
00:01:36,130 --> 00:01:39,600
♪Do good and cultivate virtue,
and worries will fade away♪

29
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:41,880
♪Don't frown over gains and losses♪

30
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:45,720
♪True cultivation lies
in a joyful heart♪

31
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,840
♪Let right and wrong, love and hatred
drift away with the wind♪

32
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Live freely and wander this world
without restraint♪

33
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,000
=The Mad Monk: Subdue Demons of Dragon's Fall=
=Episode 15=

34
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:57,960
Ms. Ke.

35
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:04,240
Don't be scared. Don't be scared.

36
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:05,480
She doesn't bite.

37
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,520
Yes. Yes.

38
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:07,360
How could you just open the door?

39
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,280
At least knock first.

40
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,680
Seriously... sorry about that.

41
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:11,160
Hope we didn't interrupt you.

42
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:13,200
You know, making babies.

43
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:15,680
Master.

44
00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:17,920
You came here so late at night.

45
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:19,040
What's it for?

46
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,360
Here's the thing.

47
00:02:20,880 --> 00:02:22,920
Everyone went crazy today.

48
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:23,480
Right?

49
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,150
It's because they used

50
00:02:25,150 --> 00:02:27,280
that Rouge Snow.

51
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:29,000
That's why we came here

52
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,320
to ask you two

53
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:33,320
if you know anything
about what's going on.

54
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,840
Rouge Snow?

55
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,400
I heard from my father

56
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,390
that Rouge Snow

57
00:02:38,390 --> 00:02:40,120
was discontinued

58
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,280
because there were no fine pearls
left as ingredients.

59
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,160
- Huh?
- Ah?

60
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:43,080
- Discontinued?
- Discontinued?

61
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,000
That's strange.

62
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,600
Then where did they get
so much Rouge Snow

63
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,640
enough to give everyone a box?

64
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:48,920
Master.

65
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:50,280
You must have misunderstood.

66
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,600
My father would never hurt anyone.

67
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,480
Calm down.

68
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:55,440
I'm not saying your father did it.

69
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:55,960
It's just that

70
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,960
this sudden supply of Rouge Snow

71
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:59,640
is indeed suspicious.

72
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,640
I remember now.

73
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,640
Mr. Ke told me yesterday

74
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:07,480
that he found a new ingredient

75
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:09,480
that could replace pearls
in making Rouge Snow.

76
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,360
- Ingredient?
- Ingredient?

77
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,640
I remember

78
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,600
he told me

79
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:17,360
that he found a miraculous herb

80
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,400
at the mass graveyard east of the city.

81
00:03:19,640 --> 00:03:20,640
A miraculous herb?

82
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:24,840
The mass graveyard east of the city?

83
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,280
Alright,

84
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,400
we won't disturb you any longer.

85
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:29,240
May you have a child soon.

86
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,360
Two in three years!

87
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,240
May your family flourish.

88
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:32,800
Get to bed early.

89
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,600
And sleep late.

90
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,480
- You can do it!
- You can do it!

91
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,520
Thank you, thank you.

92
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,440
Good luck!

93
00:03:38,160 --> 00:03:40,200
Take care. I won't see you out.

94
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,480
This...

95
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:52,080
This place is terrifying.

96
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:54,040
(Mother: Peng Yuyin)
Maybe we should come back after sunrise.

97
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:54,920
Oh, come on.

98
00:03:55,040 --> 00:03:56,400
I need to uncover the truth

99
00:03:56,400 --> 00:03:58,360
before the Thunder God strikes me down.

100
00:03:58,600 --> 00:03:59,440
Besides,

101
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,000
aren't you a demon?

102
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:02,120
What are you so afraid of?

103
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:04,160
Go by yourself.

104
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:04,800
I'm going back to Lingyin Temple.

105
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,320
No, no!

106
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:10,120
Celestial maiden! Celestial maiden!

107
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,160
Please. Come on.

108
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,680
Hmm.

109
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,200
Stay close.

110
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:15,720
Oh.

111
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,880
Let's go that way.

112
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,040
Well...

113
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,040
Hey, stay close!

114
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:41,080
Ah!

115
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,200
What happened?

116
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,560
What happened? What happened?

117
00:04:44,793 --> 00:04:45,640
What happened?

118
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,760
A ghost! A ghost!

119
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,640
There's nothing here.

120
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,320
You're just scaring yourself.

121
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,600
A ghost! A ghost!

122
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,240
Even if there are ghosts,

123
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,520
they're probably a bunch of silly ones.

124
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,640
Besides, I'm here.

125
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:57,960
Nothing will go wrong.

126
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:58,560
Ah!

127
00:04:59,200 --> 00:04:59,840
Yes!

128
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,360
Right?

129
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,200
We are not scared.

130
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,840
We are not scared!

131
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:04,800
We are not scared!

132
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:06,280
Let's just go home.

133
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,240
Amitabha Buddha.

134
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:17,680
Demon, please forgive me. I was just...

135
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,480
Master.

136
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,040
It's us.

137
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,720
You?

138
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,640
Bizuo, Biyou.

139
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,480
Why are you awake at this hour

140
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,040
and sneaking out here?

141
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:27,920
Master,

142
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,640
a demon has been sealed
inside this tower.

143
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:31,600
You said if something was wrong,

144
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,280
we should come to find you right away.

145
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,280
(Benefactor.)

146
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,120
(What are you doing?)

147
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:36,040
(Help!)

148
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,480
That voice sounds familiar.

149
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,840
(My benefactor has gone crazy!)

150
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,520
(Let me out!)

151
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:42,320
Oh, it's you.

152
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,000
Little fox.

153
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,280
Why do you smell so strongly of rouge?

154
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:45,960
Could it be

155
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:47,840
he used Mr. Ke's rouge too?

156
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:48,840
(Yeah.)

157
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:50,080
(He went crazy after using it.)

158
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:50,720
(Ouch!)

159
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,000
(Don't bite there!)

160
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,160
We've searched all night

161
00:05:55,160 --> 00:05:55,960
but still haven't found
that miracle herb.

162
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,240
What exactly did Mr. Ke

163
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:59,560
use to make his new rouge?

164
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,560
(I know! I know!)

165
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,240
You know?

166
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:03,160
(Mr. Ke's son-in-law
gave him the recipe.)

167
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,160
(I saw it myself.)

168
00:06:04,400 --> 00:06:05,520
(Let me out!)

169
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,480
(Ah!)

170
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,240
It's him.

171
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,960
Then why did he send us here?

172
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,680
We'll find out if we ask him.

173
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:12,560
Let's go.

174
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:14,200
Monk.

175
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,480
Ah!

176
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,320
Calm down. Calm down.

177
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,800
Calm down.

178
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,000
Monk.

179
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,400
Since you're here, don't even think
about leaving.

180
00:06:22,400 --> 00:06:24,000
Which fool

181
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,080
dares to

182
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:27,800
show off in front of me?

183
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,600
But...

184
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,760
Why is there such

185
00:06:31,760 --> 00:06:33,360
a strong fishy smell?

186
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,040
I am

187
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,160
the River God.

188
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,120
I thought you were something impressive.

189
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:43,200
Turns out you're just a bunch
of freshwater delicacies.

190
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,240
Why don't you stay soaking in the water,

191
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,080
where you belong?

192
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:47,160
Why come all the way here?

193
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,120
Who asked you to interfere?

194
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,040
Prepare to die!

195
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:52,040
A bunch of stinky fish and shrimp

196
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:53,120
dare to scare me?

197
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,080
Go! Go!

198
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,800
You go hide first.

199
00:06:55,900 --> 00:06:56,800
- Okay.
- Go.

200
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,640
Don't come any closer!

201
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:21,560
Little fox,

202
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:23,240
if you want to save your benefactor,

203
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,200
help me deal with these river
creatures first.

204
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:26,920
(Let me out first!)

205
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:28,520
Dragon-Subduing Arhat

206
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:28,960
is the most

207
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:29,360
handsome guy

208
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,040
in the world!

209
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:33,600
Who told you to use that password?

210
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,880
You're pretty good, aren't you?

211
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:41,360
Why does my face hurt so much?

212
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,440
Am I okay?

213
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,640
Well...

214
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,760
Watch out behind you!

215
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,040
Master!

216
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:08,880
Master!

217
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:10,640
What are you standing around for?

218
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,040
Go start a fire!

219
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,760
Huh?

220
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,280
Why?

221
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,280
We're grilling freshwater delicacies.

222
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:15,960
See?

223
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,680
We can grill freshwater delicacies?

224
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:20,520
Of course.

225
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:21,240
Hurry up.

226
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,480
Dear,

227
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,600
I don't know what's wrong with me today.

228
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,360
My stomach is acting up again.

229
00:08:27,880 --> 00:08:29,000
And I feel a little dizzy.

230
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:37,640
You might be pregnant.

231
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:40,080
What are you talking about?

232
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,880
We haven't even consummated
our marriage.

233
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:43,240
How could I be pregnant?

234
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:44,120
I...

235
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,840
I think I'm...

236
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,600
getting sleepy.

237
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,880
Ke Ayao.

238
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:01,280
I've finally waited for this day.

239
00:09:05,680 --> 00:09:07,040
Sorry.

240
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:07,800
I forgot to knock again.

241
00:09:09,680 --> 00:09:10,800
You young people

242
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,920
are something else.

243
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:15,200
You turned your wedding night
into a knife fight?

244
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,040
Those idiots.

245
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:18,720
They actually let you escape
that quickly?

246
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,240
They were impressive.

247
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,240
Really impressive.

248
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:23,760
But they tasted so good.

249
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:24,880
I almost ate myself to death.

250
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,560
How is she even more desperate than us?

251
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,700
You tricked Mr. Ke into making

252
00:09:35,700 --> 00:09:37,200
the poisonous Rouge Snow,

253
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:39,240
and now you're trying to harm Ms. Ke.

254
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:41,000
There must be more to this story.

255
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:41,920
Come on, tell me everything.

256
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:45,040
I'll listen while I eat these crabs.

257
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:52,840
Go after him!

258
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,040
Why the rush?

259
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:57,560
Do you really think he can
escape my grasp?

260
00:09:59,040 --> 00:09:59,600
Go.

261
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,360
I finally lost them.

262
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,680
You really thought you could get away?

263
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:20,000
(Ke Residence)
Explain yourself

264
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:22,320
before you leave.

265
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:29,960
So he has spiritual power.

266
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,200
Then why did I chase him all this way?

267
00:10:32,160 --> 00:10:33,560
Could this be a diversion?

268
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,520
Figure it out yourself.

269
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:36,440
No, no.

270
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,040
Wait.

271
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:38,840
Take me with you.

272
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,320
Hold on tight.

273
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:46,600
Where did Dragon-Subduing Arhat
disappear to?

274
00:10:49,560 --> 00:10:50,760
- Don't run!
- Don't run!

275
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:55,640
Thunder God! Thunder God!

276
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,560
Perfect timing.

277
00:10:56,760 --> 00:10:57,280
Thunder God!

278
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:57,800
Quick!

279
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:58,600
He's a demon!

280
00:10:58,840 --> 00:10:59,520
Strike him down!

281
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,840
Demon, prepare to die!

282
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:06,080
My whole body is numb!

283
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,040
Chase him!

284
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:14,640
Forget it.

285
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:16,040
He's way too fast in the water.

286
00:11:16,040 --> 00:11:17,000
How are you supposed to catch him?

287
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:19,360
I'll find someone to help.

288
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:21,320
Little Alligator Dragon!

289
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:29,040
Little Alligator Dragon.

290
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:29,880
Long time no see.

291
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:30,840
Dragon-Subduing Arhat.

292
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:41,750
♪My shoes are worn, my hat is torn♪

293
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:45,010
♪Even my monk's robe is tattered♪

294
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:48,810
♪Everything I own is worn and weathered♪

295
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:51,840
♪Yet I laugh and live free as can be♪

296
00:11:52,300 --> 00:11:59,050
♪Namo Amitabha Buddha♪

297
00:11:59,070 --> 00:12:02,600
♪With Buddha dwelling in my heart♪

298
00:12:09,310 --> 00:12:12,510
♪Once, I was known as Li Xiuyuan♪

299
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:15,770
♪Now I bear the name Ji Dian♪

300
00:12:16,060 --> 00:12:19,080
♪After the wedding,
I became an immortal♪

301
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:20,770
♪I thought of the Arhat
who subdued the tiger♪

302
00:12:20,810 --> 00:12:22,690
♪And there he was, right by my side,
oh my♪

303
00:12:22,730 --> 00:12:24,250
♪I left my wife behind♪

304
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:25,850
♪And headed straight to Lingyin Temple♪

305
00:12:25,890 --> 00:12:29,670
♪Living a life of hiding here
and running there♪

306
00:12:29,730 --> 00:12:30,810
♪As long as thunder doesn't strike♪

307
00:12:30,820 --> 00:12:32,910
♪I still dare to make a solemn vow♪

308
00:12:32,950 --> 00:12:34,610
♪With me around, nothing can go wrong♪

309
00:12:34,650 --> 00:12:36,480
♪Waiter, bring me a plate
of chicken wings♪

310
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:39,840
♪People laugh and say I'm lost
and foolish♪

311
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:43,110
♪Guangliang always nags and scolds me♪

312
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:46,240
♪His endless lectures come
from worry I'll cause trouble♪

313
00:12:46,260 --> 00:12:49,610
♪I say Buddha lives within my heart♪

314
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:53,270
♪Wine and meat may pass through my body♪

315
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:56,620
♪I wander around, I stroll along♪

316
00:12:56,660 --> 00:12:59,730
♪Leaving all my worries behind♪

317
00:13:00,310 --> 00:13:03,360
♪Take a sip, take a bite♪

318
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:06,800
♪I don't overthink this life of mine♪

319
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:10,360
♪You chase fame and fight
over fortune and fate♪

320
00:13:10,380 --> 00:13:13,840
♪You're just wasting your time♪

321
00:13:13,890 --> 00:13:16,810
♪They all call me a Living Buddha♪

322
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:18,470
♪And I just laugh happily♪

323
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:21,880
♪Wishing joy and happiness
for all in this world♪

